WEBVTT

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:05.180
I finally found you...

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:07.500
Sam, what are you doing here?

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.620
I was looking for you!

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:15.590
Jack told me that if that isn't the 
kind of duel you're striving for...

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.390
Then prove it with a duel!

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:22.470
Show me the true duel that 
Yuya Sakaki believes in.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:26.340
If you're trying to accomplish something,

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:27.670
do not falter!

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:32.610
I... The duels I believe in, with all my heart...

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:38.190
The duels we learned at You Show 
School don't exist to hurt people.

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:39.790
Entertainment duels...

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:42.550
...bring people joy and smiles.

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:45.280
Yuya?

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:46.590
Yuya, where are you going?

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.560
I'm going to the Duel Palace!

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.220
Jack's waiting there.

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:55.220
To use our entertainment duel to save City!

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.630
D-Wheels.

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:02.800
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:04.490
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:07.930
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:10.120
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:49.010
Borrowed Words

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:54.220
Jack Atlas and I are about to fight 
in the Friendship Cup finals!

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:57.420
I want to show you all...

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.890
Duels aren't tools of war.

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:02.360
Duels exist to make people happy,

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:04.260
to make people smile.

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:09.780
I'm going to use this duel to prove that to you!

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.980
I will not allow it!

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:22.730
Yuya Sakaki, Jack Atlas,

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:26.100
and the Administrative Council's 
old fools... I'll show you all...

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:33.390
That I, Jean-Michel Roget, am the 
true authority in City!

00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:46.470
Attention, security squads in 
front of the Duel Palace.

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:51.610
Turn around at once, and storm the Duel Palace.

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:59.960
Arrest all who disobey my order 
and seek to hold the finals!

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:05.030
Security's trying to escape into the Duel Palace.

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:07.390
After them... We'll break our way in, too!

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:11.830
Drive both Tops and security 
from the Duel Palace!

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:14.930
Battle!

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:19.780
I attack Jutte Fighter with 
Abyss Actor — Superstar!

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:29.050
I attack Goyo Defender with Lightshower!

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:38.690
Superheavy Samurai Warlord 
Susanowo attacks Jutte Lord!

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:44.730
Go!

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:48.830
Raidraptor — Rise Falcon, 
tear apart all our enemies.

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:51.470
Flame Claw Evolution!

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:59.840
D/D/D Oblivion King Abyss 
Ragnarok attacks Goyo King!

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:02.660
The End of Judgment!

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:14.720
So, this is the power of Reiji Akaba,

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:18.000
the Professor's son?

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:25.990
Layra!

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:38.950
Your name is Layra, yes?

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.230
I hope that you set your mind to something.

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:44.940
So that, someday, I can see you gallantly duel.

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:51.260
Level 3 Critical Eye tunes the Critical Tuning

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:54.900
that filmed Level 3 Goyo Catapult!

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:58.110
Burned image of the shooter of iron hammers,

00:05:58.110 --> 00:06:01.500
synchronize with my eye and offer me your power!

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:03.740
Synchro Summon!

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:08.080
Come out, exquisite gun that 
shoots through everything.

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:12.410
Level 6 C/C/C Rock Blaster of Battle!

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:14.650
Battle.

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:16.590
Go, Rock Blaster!

00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:18.890
Attack Goyo Catapult!

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:30.870
Brother...

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:34.970
They cleared security out?

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:36.940
Who are these guys?

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:40.490
But that means no one's left to protect the Tops!

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:44.720
Yeah! The Tops still here 
are basically defenseless!

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:48.920
Starting today, the Duel Palace 
belongs to us Commons alone.

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:54.330
That's right! Let's crush those 
jerks in their ivory towers!

00:06:54.590 --> 00:06:56.180
Get them!

00:06:57.610 --> 00:06:58.700
Silence!

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:03.840
This Duel Palace is holy ground for duelists.

00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:07.440
I, the king, will not allow you to defile 
it with violence and blood!

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:08.980
Listen.

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:14.700
Starting now, Yuya Sakaki and I will 
duel, with City's future on the line.

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:18.250
I won't let anyone get in our way.

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.620
If you care about City's future,

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:23.860
then watch this duel to its end!

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:26.320
What is he talking about?

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:31.300
You aren't the ones who decide the future! I am!

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:36.530
But very well, then.

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:40.250
If you want to duel that much, go ahead.

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:43.610
That is, if you can both survive to the end...

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:48.630
Yuya...

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:54.520
If they say it's a battle to decide City's future,

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:56.650
I have to take part in that.

00:07:57.220 --> 00:08:01.870
And I wouldn't be able to stand the 
frustration of coming this far

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:04.150
and not commenting to the very end.

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:09.630
So I'll stake my future as a newscaster 
on the two of them, too.

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:14.310
On the duelists in the Friendship Cup finals,

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:17.620
Yuya Sakaki and Jack Atlas.

00:08:20.010 --> 00:08:24.580
First into the venue is Yuya Sakaki!

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:29.370
We're counting on you, Yuya!

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:31.480
For City's future!

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:33.190
Fight hard!

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:35.530
It's rather frustrating...

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:38.240
In terms of skill, we aren't that different.

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:40.800
Why does he always get the spotlight?

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:45.360
Like cards, people all have their own roles.

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:46.560
Right, Sam?

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:48.890
Yes, that's what Jack said.

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:52.280
Hey! Are you saying I'm 
a supporting character?

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:54.270
I'm the one who uses Superstar!

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:56.090
Quiet down.

00:08:56.850 --> 00:09:01.150
The real star... Rather, the king 
is taking the stage.

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:06.820
And here he is!

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:11.760
The star of City, Jack Atlas!

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.870
There is but one king! And that is I!

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:24.810
Mr. Atlas...

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:27.510
Jack!

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:32.670
Of course, he's still City's pride and joy, 
the King of Duelists, Jack Atlas!

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:37.720
Just by showing up, he's captured the 
audience's heart in the Duel Palace!

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:41.240
The excitement from his duel 
with Sergey hasn't cooled.

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:46.700
Here, in the finals, what kind of 
entertainment will he show us?

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:51.670
Will you ask the spectators this time?

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:54.110
What turn you should beat me on?

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:56.440
Are you mocking me?!

00:09:57.900 --> 00:10:00.340
No, not just me...

00:10:00.340 --> 00:10:03.220
All of the duelists you've beaten up till now.

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:06.580
You are unworthy to fight me!

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:08.550
Leave now!

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:11.910
I...

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:15.030
I'm not going anywhere!

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:18.080
I'm here, carrying the feelings

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:22.250
of those who lost in the tournament... 
Shinji, Crow, everyone!

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:24.500
Yuya...

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:26.470
And not just them.

00:10:27.030 --> 00:10:33.300
I'm here with the allies I've fought 
beside all this time, to come this far.

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:36.880
Jack Atlas, we'll all be fighting you!

00:10:38.390 --> 00:10:42.850
A true king must be able to bear the feelings 
of the losers on his shoulders, as well.

00:10:43.570 --> 00:10:45.130
Then, have pride!

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:49.830
Be a man who's worthy of challenging 
the king, Yuya Sakaki!

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:57.680
In tournament history, we've never held 
a finals match amidst such chaos.

00:10:57.680 --> 00:11:00.970
But I believe that makes it even more meaningful.

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:04.750
After all, this is the Friendship Cup.

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:09.190
City is united as one. We're all friends. 
That's the point of this tournament!

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:13.200
Well, I'm trying to sound cool here,

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:15.620
but you all want to see it, don't you?

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:18.090
The ultimate battle, man against man,

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:22.860
between King of Duelists 
Jack Atlas and Yuya Sakaki,

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:26.330
who's returned with indomitable will 
after an opening ceremony loss!

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:28.330
Well, let's get started.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:30.170
Action Field, on.

00:11:30.170 --> 00:11:32.170
Crossover Acceleration!

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:34.160
Duel mode, on.

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:36.310
Autopilot, stand by.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:40.170
Riding duel...

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:42.200
Acceleration!

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:43.880
Duel!

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:49.790
I take the first turn!

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:53.260
I activate Red Sprinter from my hand!

00:11:56.840 --> 00:11:59.820
When this is the only monster on the field,

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:04.740
I can Special Summon one Tuner Monster, 
Level 3 or below, from my hand.

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:07.640
I Special Summon Red Resonator.

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:16.950
Level 2 Red Resonator tunes 
Level 4 Red Sprinter!

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:23.010
Let the scarlet souls become one.

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:25.420
Tremble before the champion's war cry!

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:27.390
Synchro Summon.

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:30.900
Come out, Red Wyvern!

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:36.070
Jack gets the first turn!

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:40.360
He immediately calls out two monsters, 
and uses them in a Synchro Summons!

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:45.310
W-Wait, his actions so far are the same 
as in the opening ceremony match?

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:47.780
There's no question.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:50.700
Jack is asking me,

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:54.630
"How much have you grown since then"?

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:58.310
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:01.790
Now, bring it, Yuya Sakaki.

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:03.930
I'll evaluate your duel.

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:06.430
Yeah, I will.

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:08.600
With the duel I believe in...

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:11.030
With the entertainment duel 
I inherited from my dad...

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:14.180
I'll make you, along with everyone,

00:13:14.740 --> 00:13:16.370
smile!

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:21.740
Inherited, eh?

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:37.660
The Friendship Cup finals.

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:39.260
Jack takes the first turn,

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:43.050
playing the cards he used in the opening 
ceremony, throwing down the gauntlet.

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:46.340
Now, what will Yuya Sakaki do?!

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:52.440
I swore to Yuzu...

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:57.700
That I'd bring back the smiles of City's 
people with my entertainment duels.

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:00.890
My turn!

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:05.420
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 1 
Performapal Gumgumouton

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:10.360
and Scale 5 Performapal Bubblebowwow.

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:19.500
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 2 and 4 simultaneously.

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:22.470
Swing, my soul's pendulum.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:25.060
Draw a shining arc in the sky!

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:27.080
Pendulum Summon!

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:28.340
Appear!

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:31.750
Timebreaker Magician!

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:37.980
When there's a Special Summoned 
monster on your side of the field,

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:42.260
I can Special Summon Performapal 
Radish Horse from my hand!

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:50.770
Hey, Pendulum can summon a bunch 
of monsters at once, right?

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:54.700
So, why did he summon 
the two separately?

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:57.080
Dunno.

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:03.420
Its 1400 attack points...

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:04.880
...became 2800!

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:08.620
When Timebreaker Magician is Pendulum 
Summoned alone from my hand,

00:15:09.160 --> 00:15:11.220
its attack points are doubled!

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:12.790
I see...

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:18.100
He Special Summoned Radish Horse 
separately to activate that effect.

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:19.530
Good job, Yuya.

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:23.000
Well, I did the same thing myself.

00:15:23.390 --> 00:15:26.280
Watch me, Dad... Mom.

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:30.540
You told me to never forget my smile.

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:34.520
I'll put that feeling into the cards.

00:15:35.180 --> 00:15:38.040
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:42.150
Feast your eyes on this card of mine.

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:45.920
It's called "Smile World."

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:50.830
Now I, Sakaki Yuya, will use 
this obviously fun card

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:56.630
to provide entertainment and bring 
smiles to everyone in City!

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:03.110
Let's get to it. I activate my 
spell card Smile World!

00:16:04.390 --> 00:16:08.400
When it's activated, until the end 
of my turn, the attack points of

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:13.080
all monsters on the field increase 
by 100 times their total number.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.550
All monsters on the field...

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:20.060
So Jack's Red Wyvern's attack points go up, too?

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:22.860
Even if you want to bring smiles to everyone...

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:25.100
He's giving charity to the enemy?

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:26.880
What's he thinking?

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:29.870
I'd never do that!

00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:35.230
There are a total of three monsters on 
my and Jack's sides of the field.

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:37.580
Thus, their attack points increase by 300.

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:42.050
And I activate Radish Horse's monster effect!

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:45.630
Once per turn, after this card 
is Special Summoned,

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:50.720
it can reduce the attack points of one monster 
on your field, with 2500 points or more,

00:16:50.720 --> 00:16:53.960
by Radish Horse's current attack points.

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:59.420
Then, it increases the attack points of one 
monster on my field by the same amount.

00:16:59.420 --> 00:17:03.170
I choose to increase Timebreaker 
Magician's attack points!

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:13.610
3900 attack points!

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:14.990
I see!

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:16.650
So that was his strategy?

00:17:16.650 --> 00:17:19.580
Well done, Yuya. You really had me fooled.

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:22.420
I knew it the whole time, of course.

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:25.890
Timebreaker Magician, which previously 
had 1400 attack points,

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:29.420
has been powered up to 3900!

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:32.630
Well, Jack? This is how I'm dueling now!

00:17:33.520 --> 00:17:35.950
I'll show you the power of 
my father's Smile World,

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:38.380
the power of the entertainment duel.

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.100
Battle!

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:44.270
I attack Red Wyvern with Timebreaker Magician!

00:17:46.060 --> 00:17:50.080
This is why I say your duels are self-satisfaction!

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:54.670
I activate my trap King's Synchro.

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:59.660
When a Synchro Monster on my side 
of the field is targeted by an attack,

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:01.990
I can negate battle,

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:07.130
and use that Synchro Monster and 
a Tuner Monster in the graveyard

00:18:07.130 --> 00:18:09.420
as components for a Synchro Summon.

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:16.310
Level 2 Red Resonator, in my graveyard, 
tunes Level 6 Red Wyvern!

00:18:17.330 --> 00:18:20.310
The cry of the champion shakes 
heaven and earth.

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:24.570
Let the conqueror's unique power 
be carved into your body!

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:26.760
Synchro Summon.

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:30.090
The raging soul...

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:33.050
Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:42.930
Jack stopped Yuya's attack and 
brought out his ace monster!

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:45.640
You haven't grown at all...

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:49.450
Not one bit, since I defeated you the 
night of the opening ceremony!

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:52.120
No... I...

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:56.490
I have one Xiangke Magician in my hand.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:59.540
I can't do anything
 from this position.

00:19:00.520 --> 00:19:01.820
I end my turn.

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:06.430
Timebreaker Magician...

00:19:06.430 --> 00:19:08.260
Its attack points went back to normal!

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:12.230
Radish Horse's and Smile World's effects 
only last until the End Phase.

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:15.670
When the turn ends, the effects also end.

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:18.780
Smile World... Dad's...

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:21.170
It's because you are still 
obsessed with that card

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:23.270
that you cannot recognize

00:19:24.110 --> 00:19:25.480
your own duel!

00:19:27.490 --> 00:19:30.300
No, this is my duel!

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:33.260
The entertainment duel I inherited 
from my dad is my—

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:35.110
Don't speak to me with borrowed words.

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:38.870
If you want to talk to me, 
speak with your own words.

00:19:39.270 --> 00:19:40.810
With your duel!

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:45.100
My... words?

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:48.570
What a pity.

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:52.000
Your fates are already sealed.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:56.170
You can both roll down destruction's path together!

00:19:58.650 --> 00:20:01.110
Huh? On the course...

00:20:02.810 --> 00:20:04.970
What are the Duel Chasers doing there?

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:08.290
And fifteen Goyo Emperors?!

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:18.970
Battle royal mode, joining.

00:20:20.660 --> 00:20:22.630
The Duel Chasers are joining in?

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:24.800
Roget, eh?

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:26.970
A ridiculous attempt to stand against the king.

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:29.630
I shall not give in to you,

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:31.750
no matter what measures you take.

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:35.450
I shall bury all who stand against me!

00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:38.910
Get them, five Duel Chasers!

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:39.650
Battle.

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:44.390
I attack Radish Horse with Goyo Emperor!

00:20:51.910 --> 00:20:53.730
Action Spell Evade!

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:55.700
I negate the attack.

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:59.990
And Goyo Emperor attacks Radish Horse!

00:21:01.850 --> 00:21:03.110
Damn!

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:06.180
I activate my trap Red Connection.

00:21:07.310 --> 00:21:10.360
When there is a Red Monster 
on my side of the field,

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:14.990
and one monster's battle has been negated, 
I can force an end to the Battle Phase

00:21:14.990 --> 00:21:20.340
and reduce, by 500, the attack points of 
all monsters on my opponents' fields.

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:26.360
A duelist who chases his father 
in dreams is no more than a fly.

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:29.100
My turn!

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:33.300
I see I set my hopes for this duel too high.

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:38.960
The duelist Yuya Sakaki, fixated on emulating 
his father, isn't worth speaking to...

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:42.280
And the selfish Roget is out of the question!

00:21:42.850 --> 00:21:46.090
Those who do not try to understand 
the core of dueling

00:21:46.090 --> 00:21:48.290
must disappear from my sight!

00:21:48.670 --> 00:21:52.160
I activate the effect of Scarlight 
Red Dragon Archfiend.

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:53.630
Once per turn,

00:21:53.630 --> 00:21:57.520
it can destroy all monsters with attack 
points equal to, or lower, than its own.

00:21:57.930 --> 00:22:01.170
Absolute Power Flame!

00:23:53.340 --> 00:23:56.080
I've found them, Jack! My own words!

00:23:56.080 --> 00:23:59.980
Then cry out with those words! With your duel!

00:23:59.980 --> 00:24:04.990
Level 8 Enlightenment Paladin 
tunes Level 2 Cheermole!

00:24:04.990 --> 00:24:05.520
What?

00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:09.000
Enlightenment Paladin isn't a Tuner Monster!

00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:11.060
From beyond the time of peace,

00:24:11.060 --> 00:24:13.400
releasing light to the world, far and wide...

00:24:13.400 --> 00:24:14.570
Be reborn!

00:24:15.080 --> 00:24:19.140
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Nirvana High Paladin.

00:24:19.500 --> 00:24:21.400
The fun is only getting started!
